 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/10/06 20:36| 02 | 039| 016| 0251| 0072| 0159| 0384|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/10/06 20:36| 01 | 304| 014| 0356| 0247| 0267| 0892|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/10/06 17:00| 02 | 074| 006| 0188| 0094| 0139| 0361|    \n  <a href=\"CME0019/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0019</a>|2026/10/06 07:24| 01 | 234| 018| 0339| 0034| 0294| 0367|    \n  <a href=\"CME0018/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0018</a>|2026/10/06 07:12| 02 | 346| 134| 0393| 0124| 0193| 0762|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0017/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0017</a>|2026/10/06 01:48| 02 | 307| 036| 022"
